[*] attacker target (outside workDir): /tmp/oras-PWNED
[*] baseAbs depth = 3, building 3 nested dirs
[*] store.AllowPathTraversalOnWrite = false

[!] BYPASS: wrote "PWNED-BY-ORAS-TARSLIP" to /tmp/oras-PWNED
